WEBVTT

00:07.517 --> 00:08.896
- Are you ready, kids?
- 孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:08.965 --> 00:10.448
kids:
Aye, aye, Captain!
孩子们：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:10.551 --> 00:12.103
- I can't hear you.
- 我听不到你说话。

00:12.137 --> 00:14.068
kids:
Aye, aye, Captain!
孩子们：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:14.137 --> 00:17.103
- ♪ Ohh... ♪
- ♪ 哦...♪

00:17.137 --> 00:19.103
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:19.206 --> 00:21.103
kids:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
孩子们：
海绵宝宝！

00:21.206 --> 00:23.034
- ♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪
- ♪ 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的 ♪

00:23.103 --> 00:24.965
kids:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
孩子们：
海绵宝宝！

00:25.000 --> 00:27.172
- ♪ If nautical nonsense
be something you wish ♪
- ♪ 如果航海废话
成为你想要的东西♪

00:27.241 --> 00:29.206
kids:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
孩子们：
海绵宝宝！

00:29.275 --> 00:31.206
- ♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪
- ♪ 然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:31.275 --> 00:33.103
kids: SpongeBob SquarePants!
- Ready?
孩子们：海绵宝宝！
- 准备好？

00:33.206 --> 00:35.034
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:35.103 --> 00:37.172
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:37.241 --> 00:39.068
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:39.137 --> 00:40.517
- SpongeBob
- 海绵宝宝

00:40.586 --> 00:42.344
SquarePants!
方裤！

00:42.413 --> 00:45.034
[laughing]
[笑]

00:45.103 --> 00:47.344
[flute plays]
[长笛演奏]

00:47.413 --> 00:48.793
[waves crashing]
[海浪拍打]

00:50.413 --> 00:53.310
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

00:53.379 --> 00:59.551
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

00:59.620 --> 01:01.448
- Ah, uh...
- 啊，呃...

01:01.517 --> 01:05.310
[whimpering]
[crowd clamoring]
[呜咽]
[人群喧闹]

01:05.413 --> 01:06.793
Hold on! Hold on!
坚持，稍等！坚持，稍等！

01:06.862 --> 01:08.137
Coming right up!
- Now!
马上就来了！
- 现在！

01:08.206 --> 01:12.620
- Give me a second!
- Order up, up, up!
- 等一下！
- 订单增加，订单增加，订单增加！

01:12.689 --> 01:16.482
[clamoring continues]
- Mr. Squidward!
[叫喊声继续]
- 章鱼哥先生！

01:16.517 --> 01:19.379
Why haven't you
taken out the trash?
你为什么没有
把垃圾拿出来了？

01:19.482 --> 01:23.482
- [munching, groans]
- [咀嚼，呻吟]

01:23.551 --> 01:26.827
[crowd clamoring]
- I'm swamped, Mr. Krabs!
[人群喧闹]
- 我被淹没了，蟹老板！

01:26.862 --> 01:29.379
Why are you wearing a towel?
[crowd clamoring]
你为什么戴着毛巾？
[人群喧闹]

01:29.482 --> 01:32.448
- Well, obviously,
I was in me sauna.
- 嗯，显然，
我在桑拿房里。

01:32.517 --> 01:35.000
Being a manager is
hard work, you know?
成为一名经理就是
辛苦你知道吗？

01:35.034 --> 01:36.172
- You have to do better.
- 你必须做得更好。

01:36.275 --> 01:39.655
- Can't you help
me a little bit?
- 你能帮忙吗
我一点点？

01:39.724 --> 01:42.172
- A manager does
not do grunt work.
- 经理这样做
不做繁重的工作。

01:42.241 --> 01:44.275
That's what Squidwards are for.
这就是章鱼哥的用途。

01:44.344 --> 01:47.310
[laughs]
[笑]

01:47.413 --> 01:48.793
- Hmmph!
- 哼！

01:48.862 --> 01:52.620
I deserve to be manager
and sit on my butt all day.
我值得当经理
整天坐在我的屁股上。

01:52.655 --> 01:55.551
But will I ever get promoted?
但我会升职吗？

01:55.655 --> 01:58.379
- Are you tired
of being a loser?
- 你累了吗
成为失败者？

01:58.482 --> 02:00.206
- Yes.
[sputters]
- 是的。
[溅射声]

02:00.310 --> 02:02.068
Wait, who said that?
等等，谁说的？

02:02.103 --> 02:05.482
- Wouldn't you
rather be a weenie?
- 你不会吗
宁愿做一个小屁孩？

02:05.551 --> 02:07.344
- Um, not exactly.
- 嗯，不完全是。

02:07.413 --> 02:11.586
- Weenie Hut Jr.'s is
now hiring managers.
- 小威尼小屋 (Weenie Hut Jr.) 是
现在正在招聘经理。

02:11.620 --> 02:14.000
Your responsibilities
will include...
你的责任
将包括...

02:14.068 --> 02:15.448
- Whoa.
- 哇哦。

02:15.551 --> 02:18.827
- Kicking back, relaxing,
and letting robots
- 踢回来，放松，
并让机器人

02:18.896 --> 02:20.965
do all of the grunt work.
完成所有繁重的工作。

02:21.034 --> 02:22.896
- Righteous.
- 正义。

02:23.000 --> 02:24.827
[slurping]
[发出声音]

02:24.896 --> 02:27.620
- Apply now
to Weenie Hut Jr.'s
- 立即申请
前往 Weenie Hut Jr. 的

02:27.689 --> 02:31.275
and become a pivotal cog
in the corporate machine.
并成为关键齿轮
在公司机器上。

02:31.379 --> 02:33.551
[static whirs]
- A manager?
[静电呼呼声]
- 经理？

02:33.655 --> 02:35.172
That's for me!
那是给我的！

02:35.241 --> 02:37.068
Whoo-hoo!
呼呼！

02:37.172 --> 02:40.034
- Whoa!
- So long, Krusty Krab!
- 哇！
- 再见，蟹堡王！

02:40.068 --> 02:41.896
- So long!
- 这么久！

02:43.689 --> 02:45.793
- Where is that
blasted cashier?
-那是哪里
该死的收银员？

02:45.862 --> 02:47.413
He's already an hour late.
他已经迟到一个小时了。

02:47.517 --> 02:50.620
And who the heck
is this old lady?
到底是谁
这是老太太吗？

02:50.689 --> 02:52.758
- I smell pickles.
- 我闻到了泡菜的味道。

02:52.862 --> 02:55.000
- Mr. Krabs,
isn't Squidward looking
- 蟹老板先生，
看起来不像章鱼哥

02:55.068 --> 02:56.862
better than ever these days?
这些天比以往任何时候都好？

02:56.931 --> 02:58.862
- What?
That ain't Squidward.
- 什么？
那不是章鱼哥。

02:58.896 --> 03:01.413
- Hmm?
It's not?
- 唔？
它不是？

03:01.482 --> 03:04.172
Why is she wearing his hat?
她为什么戴着他的帽子？

03:04.241 --> 03:06.137
Where is he?
Is he lost?
他在哪儿？
他迷路了吗？

03:06.241 --> 03:09.000
Why is he so late?
Squidward!
他为什么这么晚？
章鱼哥！

03:09.068 --> 03:10.620
[panicked panting]
[惊慌地喘气]

03:10.724 --> 03:14.689
I'm coming to find you!
我来找你了！

03:14.758 --> 03:18.896
[grunting]
Squidward!
[咕噜声]
章鱼哥！

03:18.965 --> 03:20.482
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

03:20.586 --> 03:21.862
- Uh-huh.
- 呃哈。

03:21.931 --> 03:23.034
- Ah!
- 啊！

03:23.103 --> 03:24.448
- Yeah, mm-hmm.
- 是的，嗯嗯。

03:24.551 --> 03:26.413
- Squidward!
- 章鱼哥！

03:26.482 --> 03:28.931
Oh, I'm so glad I found you!
哦，我很高兴找到你！

03:28.965 --> 03:31.448
Now, let's get you back
to the Krusty Krab.
现在，让我们带你回来
到蟹堡王。

03:31.551 --> 03:33.551
- Oh, I don't think so.
- 哦，我不这么认为。

03:35.344 --> 03:39.448
I'm not going back
to the Krusty Krab ever.
我不会回去
永远的蟹堡王。

03:39.482 --> 03:43.620
[grunts]
Because now I am a pivotal cog
[咕哝]
因为现在我是一个关键的齿轮

03:43.689 --> 03:45.482
in the corporate machine.
在公司机器上。

03:45.586 --> 03:47.862
- Oh, no!
That sounds horrible.
- 哦，不！
听起来很可怕。

03:47.965 --> 03:52.482
- Oh, no. It sounds like
I'm the manager here.
- 哦，不。听起来像
我是这里的经理。

03:52.586 --> 03:54.517
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

03:54.586 --> 03:57.034
- Which also means I decide
- 这也意味着我决定

03:57.103 --> 04:00.137
who stays and who goes.
谁留下，谁走。

04:00.241 --> 04:02.034
Oh, Weenie Bots.
哦，维尼机器人。

04:02.137 --> 04:04.000
Kick out this riffraff.
把这个痞子赶出去。

04:04.068 --> 04:06.758
Both:
As you command, Weenie.
两者：
遵照你的命令，维尼。

04:06.827 --> 04:09.758
- [whimpering]
- [呜咽]

04:09.827 --> 04:12.000
Whoa!
哇！

04:12.068 --> 04:14.344
- Attention, Weenie Bots.
- 注意，Weenie 机器人。

04:14.379 --> 04:16.344
As your new manager,
作为你的新经理，

04:16.413 --> 04:20.172
I'll be making
a few changes around here.
我会做
这里有一些变化。

04:20.275 --> 04:22.206
- Uh-oh.
- 呃哦。

04:22.275 --> 04:25.517
- All music in the jukebox
will now be...
- 自动点唱机中的所有音乐
现在将是...

04:25.586 --> 04:27.793
smooth jazz.
流畅的爵士乐。

04:27.862 --> 04:30.517
All Weenie-themed art
所有以威尼为主题的艺术作品

04:30.586 --> 04:33.896
will now be fine art.
现在将成为美术。

04:35.689 --> 04:39.137
And, lastly,
under no circumstances
最后，
在任何情况下

04:39.206 --> 04:44.137
is anyone allowed
to interrupt my manager time.
任何人都可以
打扰我的经理时间。

04:44.206 --> 04:47.000
[door slams]
[关门声]

04:47.068 --> 04:51.517
[sighs contentedly]
Being a manager is hard work.
[满足地叹气]
成为一名经理是一项艰苦的工作。

04:51.620 --> 04:52.931
[laughs]
[笑]

04:53.000 --> 04:56.862
- Boss Weenie, you must
take out the trash.
- 维尼老板，你必须
把垃圾拿出来。

04:56.931 --> 04:59.517
- Why can't you do it?
- 为什么你做不到？

04:59.586 --> 05:02.482
- My extension cord
won't reach.
- 我的延长线
达不到。

05:04.241 --> 05:06.413
- [grunts] Still better...
- [咕哝]还是更好...

05:06.448 --> 05:09.206
[grunts]
Than the Krusty...
[咕哝]
比库斯蒂...

05:09.275 --> 05:10.862
[grunts]
Krab.
[咕哝]
蟹。

05:10.931 --> 05:12.586
[sighs]
[叹气]

05:12.655 --> 05:13.965
[garage door slams]
[车库门关上]

05:14.068 --> 05:15.379
[shattering]
[破碎]

05:15.448 --> 05:18.724
[shouting, grunts]
[喊叫，咕哝]

05:18.793 --> 05:21.344
Hey!
Open that door!
嘿！
打开那扇门！

05:21.413 --> 05:22.758
[bots laughing]
[机器人大笑]

05:22.793 --> 05:24.931
- [panting]
- [气喘吁吁]

05:25.034 --> 05:26.206
[grunts]
[咕哝]

05:26.275 --> 05:28.413
both: Hooray.
Celebration.
两人：万岁。
庆典。

05:28.517 --> 05:30.586
Celebration.
庆典。

05:30.689 --> 05:33.103
Glug, glug, glug.
咕噜，咕噜，咕噜。

05:33.206 --> 05:34.448
- Huh?
- 啊？

05:34.551 --> 05:37.896
[growling]
[咆哮]

05:37.931 --> 05:42.241
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

05:42.344 --> 05:43.586
Aah!
啊啊！

05:43.689 --> 05:44.862
[grunts]
[咕哝]

05:44.931 --> 05:47.482
- Oh, good.
You are back.
- 哦，很好。
你回来了。

05:47.551 --> 05:48.931
- Weenie.
- 维尼。

05:48.965 --> 05:50.379
- [growling]
- [咆哮]

05:50.413 --> 05:52.482
[exclaims]
[惊呼]

05:56.241 --> 05:58.275
[grunts]
[咕哝]

06:01.758 --> 06:03.310
All right, Squidward.
好吧，章鱼哥。

06:03.344 --> 06:07.206
It's time for a little
managerial work.
是时候稍微
管理工作。

06:07.310 --> 06:10.137
"How to Repair Unruly Robots."
“如何修理不守规矩的机器人。”

06:10.241 --> 06:12.103
Hmm.
唔。

06:12.172 --> 06:15.482
[tools clattering]
[工具碰撞声]

06:16.448 --> 06:18.724
[bell dings]
[铃声]

06:18.827 --> 06:22.551
[sighs]
That ought to do the trick.
[叹气]
这应该能解决问题。

06:24.931 --> 06:28.241
Weenie Bots, bring me a weenie.
威尼机器人，给我来一个威尼。

06:28.310 --> 06:30.137
both:
Yes, Mr. Manager.
两者：
是的，经理先生。

06:30.172 --> 06:32.034
[machinery whirring]
[机器的呼呼声]

06:32.137 --> 06:34.862
[sizzling]
[嘶嘶声]

06:34.965 --> 06:37.206
- [chomping]
Oh.
- [咀嚼]
哦。

06:37.275 --> 06:38.586
I did it!
我做到了！

06:38.655 --> 06:40.448
They're perfect employees now.
他们现在是完美的员工。

06:40.517 --> 06:43.344
Weenie Bots, run the store.
Weenie Bots，经营商店。

06:43.448 --> 06:45.655
[chomping]
[咀嚼]

06:45.724 --> 06:48.482
I'm having manager time.
我有经理时间。

06:48.551 --> 06:51.000
both:
Yes, Mr. Manager.
两者：
是的，经理先生。

06:51.103 --> 06:54.068
[customers clamoring]
[顾客叫嚷]

06:54.137 --> 06:57.172
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

06:57.275 --> 07:01.931
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

07:02.000 --> 07:03.655
[bell dings]
[铃声]

07:03.724 --> 07:05.379
- Ooh!
- 哦！

07:05.448 --> 07:08.517
- [playing clarinet off-key]
- [单簧管走调]

07:08.586 --> 07:10.965
[bell dings]
- [munching]
[铃声]
- [咀嚼]

07:11.034 --> 07:13.103
[cash register bell dings,
slurping]
[收银机铃响，
吸食]

07:13.206 --> 07:16.551
[cash register bell dings]
[收银铃声响起]

07:16.620 --> 07:20.137
[crowd sighing contentedly]
[众人满足地叹息]

07:20.241 --> 07:23.379
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

07:23.448 --> 07:25.793
[music box lullaby playing]
[音乐盒摇篮曲演奏]

07:25.896 --> 07:28.206
- [screams]
- Mr. Manager.
- [尖叫]
- 经理先生。

07:28.275 --> 07:31.068
- Can't you see
I'm trying to sleep?
- 你看不到吗
我想睡觉？

07:31.137 --> 07:33.000
I mean manage.
我的意思是管理。

07:33.068 --> 07:34.241
- The president
- 总统

07:34.275 --> 07:36.827
of the Weenie Hut Corporation
is arriving.
威尼小屋公司
即将抵达。

07:36.896 --> 07:39.965
- [panicked yelping]
Why didn't you say so?
- [惊慌地尖叫]
你为什么不这么说？

07:40.068 --> 07:41.482
[panting, grunting]
[气喘吁吁，咕哝]

07:41.551 --> 07:43.275
Oh.
哦。

07:49.862 --> 07:52.793
[regal music]
[富丽堂皇的音乐]

07:52.896 --> 07:54.586
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

07:54.689 --> 07:57.655
What a weenie.
真是个小家伙。

07:59.551 --> 08:01.448
- Weenie J. Weiner.
- 维尼·J·维纳。

08:01.517 --> 08:03.034
The J stands for Junior.
J 代表少年。

08:03.137 --> 08:06.724
You must be
Squidward Q. Tentacles.
你一定是
章鱼哥 Q. 触手。

08:06.793 --> 08:09.275
- The Q stands for Quincy.
- Q 代表昆西。

08:09.344 --> 08:12.379
To what do I owe this honor?
我凭什么获得这份荣誉？

08:12.482 --> 08:15.827
- Your success has been all
the buzz down at headquarters.
- 你的成功就是一切
总部的喧闹声减弱了。

08:15.931 --> 08:17.448
- Oh!
- 哦！

08:17.517 --> 08:19.586
- So I came straightaway
to offer you
- 所以我马上就来了
为您提供

08:19.655 --> 08:22.931
the big promotion.
大促销。

08:23.000 --> 08:26.827
- Finally, someone
recognizes my worth.
- 终于有人了
认可我的价值。

08:26.931 --> 08:28.689
[camera shutter clicks]
Oh.
[相机快门声]
哦。

08:28.793 --> 08:30.586
- But, first,
you'll need to take
- 但是，首先，
你需要采取

08:30.655 --> 08:33.551
our upper-management course.
我们的高层管理课程。

08:33.620 --> 08:36.862
Please, step
into my weeniecopter.
请迈步
进入我的小直升机。

08:36.965 --> 08:43.965
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

08:45.275 --> 08:47.724
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

08:47.793 --> 08:52.172
- Welcome
to Weenie Hut Senior's!
- 欢迎
到 Weenie Hut Senior's！

08:52.275 --> 08:55.517
- Oh, wow.
- 哦，哇。

08:57.103 --> 08:59.862
both:
Congratulations, Weenie.
两者：
恭喜你，维尼。

08:59.896 --> 09:04.620
- Congratulations, Weenie.
- Congratulations, Weenie.
- 恭喜你，维尼。
- 恭喜你，维尼。

09:04.724 --> 09:08.068
- There sure are a lot
of robots working here.
- 肯定有很多
在这里工作的机器人。

09:08.137 --> 09:11.896
- Yes, robots
are so much more efficient
- 是的，机器人
效率更高

09:12.000 --> 09:14.758
and sanitary.
和卫生。

09:14.862 --> 09:17.137
- Welcome, Weenie.
- 欢迎，维尼。

09:18.965 --> 09:21.448
- Please, have a seat.
- 请坐。

09:21.517 --> 09:25.379
Now lie back
and think of weenies.
现在躺下
并想到小家伙。

09:25.448 --> 09:29.137
- What exactly
is this management course?
- 到底是什么
这是管理课程吗？

09:29.206 --> 09:32.896
- Well, you see, Squidward,
we are going to turn you
- 嗯，你看，章鱼哥，
我们将把你转向

09:32.931 --> 09:37.068
into the most efficient manager
you can be...
成为最有效率的管理者
你可以...

09:37.103 --> 09:39.862
- [whimpers]
- [呜咽]

09:39.931 --> 09:43.137
- By turning you into a...
[machinery whirring]
- 通过把你变成...
[机器的呼呼声]

09:43.206 --> 09:45.620
Robot.
机器人。

09:45.724 --> 09:47.931
- Oh, a robot,
well, that sounds just--
- 哦，一个机器人，
嗯，听起来只是——

09:48.034 --> 09:49.724
[screams]
[尖叫声]

09:49.827 --> 09:52.103
Help me!
帮我！

09:52.172 --> 09:54.275
- Oh, we are helping you,
Squidward.
- 哦，我们正在帮助你，
章鱼哥。

09:54.344 --> 09:57.241
You will be...
[machinery whirring]
你将会...
[机器的呼呼声]

09:57.344 --> 10:00.068
One of us.
我们中的一员。

10:00.172 --> 10:04.241
[suspenseful music]
[悬疑音乐]

10:04.344 --> 10:05.482
- Typical.
- 典型的。

10:05.551 --> 10:09.724
[screaming]
[尖叫]

10:09.758 --> 10:11.896
- [cackling]
- [咯咯笑]

10:12.000 --> 10:15.379
- [screaming]
- [尖叫]

10:15.482 --> 10:17.586
Oh!
哦！

10:17.689 --> 10:19.896
- [cackling]
[cannon fires]
- [咯咯笑]
[大炮开火]

10:20.000 --> 10:21.206
- Huh?
- 啊？

10:21.275 --> 10:22.862
- Ahoy there, Squidward.
- 嘿，章鱼哥。

10:22.931 --> 10:25.103
We're here to save you.
我们是来拯救你的。

10:25.206 --> 10:27.655
- How did you even know
I was here?
- 你怎么知道的
我在这儿？

10:27.724 --> 10:30.344
- [cackling]
- [咯咯笑]

10:30.413 --> 10:32.275
- I knew you were in danger.
- 我知道你有危险。

10:32.379 --> 10:35.103
My squiddy sense was tingling.
我的鱿鱼感感到刺痛。

10:35.206 --> 10:37.275
- I don't want to know
what that means.
- 我不想知道
这意味着什么。

10:37.379 --> 10:39.103
Just get me out of here!
带我离开这里！

10:39.206 --> 10:41.793
- All right, SpongeBob,
load her up.
- 好吧，海绵宝宝，
加载她。

10:41.862 --> 10:43.896
- She's ready!
- 她准备好了！

10:44.000 --> 10:45.896
[grunts] Watch your head.
[咕噜声]小心你的头。

10:46.000 --> 10:48.551
[grunts]
[咕哝]

10:48.620 --> 10:50.344
- Whoo-hoo!
- 呼呼！

10:50.413 --> 10:52.000
Pinchy, pinchy.
捏捏，捏捏。

10:52.068 --> 10:53.896
- [cackling]
Huh?
- [咯咯笑]
啊？

10:53.965 --> 10:56.551
- Cutie, cutie, cutie, cutie.
- 小可爱，小可爱，小可爱，小可爱。

10:56.655 --> 10:58.965
- [screaming]
- [尖叫]

10:59.034 --> 11:02.137
- That brat's gonna burst!
- 这小子要爆炸了！

11:02.241 --> 11:04.172
- [screaming]
[alarm blaring]
- [尖叫]
[警报声]

11:07.413 --> 11:10.965
- Yummy weenie.
- 美味的维尼。

11:11.068 --> 11:13.793
- Ow.
- [exclaims]
- 噢。
- [惊呼]

11:13.827 --> 11:16.413
- Looks like we got here
just in time.
- 看来我们到了这里
正好。

11:16.482 --> 11:18.931
Good to see ya, pal.
- Oof!
很高兴见到你，朋友。
- 噢！

11:18.965 --> 11:20.620
[machinery whirring]
[机器的呼呼声]

11:20.724 --> 11:25.172
[screaming]
[尖叫]

11:25.275 --> 11:27.310
- Order up, Squidward!
[bell dinging]
- 下令吧，章鱼哥！
[铃声]

11:27.413 --> 11:30.827
Gee, it sure is great
to have you back.
哎呀，这确实很棒
让你回来。

11:30.896 --> 11:34.068
- Sigh.
Please unplug me.
- 叹息。
请拔掉我的插头。

11:35.896 --> 11:38.827
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

11:38.931 --> 11:45.413
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

11:45.482 --> 11:49.551
- "The belly of inspiration
lies in the midst of your gut."
——《灵感之腹》
就在你的肠道之中。”

11:49.620 --> 11:52.344
[sighs]
[叹气]

11:52.448 --> 11:55.137
Welp, I better return this
wonderful book to the library
好吧，我最好退回这个
去图书馆的好书

11:55.172 --> 11:57.793
before it's due.
在到期之前。

11:57.896 --> 11:59.275
Ah!
啊!

11:59.379 --> 12:01.793
[groans]
[呻吟]

12:01.862 --> 12:03.379
[grunts]
[咕哝]

12:03.482 --> 12:08.206
SpongeBob, what did I tell you
about standing too close to me?
海绵宝宝，我告诉你什么了
是因为站得离我太近吗？

12:08.310 --> 12:10.379
- Oh, you said...
- 哦，你说...

12:10.482 --> 12:13.310
[imitating Squidward] If you
keep standing too close to me,
[模仿章鱼哥] 如果你
一直站得离我太近

12:13.379 --> 12:16.000
I'm going to trip over you.
我会被你绊倒。

12:16.034 --> 12:17.862
- I rest my case...
- 我休息一下...

12:17.931 --> 12:19.206
and my face.
和我的脸。

12:19.310 --> 12:21.068
- [normal voice]
Sorry, Squidward.
- [正常声音]
对不起，章鱼哥。

12:21.137 --> 12:23.206
I just wanted to invite you
to go with me and Patrick.
我只是想邀请你
跟我和帕特里克一起去。

12:23.275 --> 12:25.379
We have a really
fun day planned.
我们有一个真正
计划了有趣的一天。

12:25.482 --> 12:27.931
Mm!
- Oh, shucks and golly gee.
毫米！
- 哦，天哪。

12:28.000 --> 12:30.206
I really wish
I could come and have big fun
我真的希望
我可以来玩得很开心

12:30.275 --> 12:31.655
with you and Patrick.
和你还有帕特里克。

12:31.724 --> 12:33.344
Eeh!
呃！

12:33.448 --> 12:34.965
- But?
- 但？

12:35.034 --> 12:37.482
- But I have to return
my favorite book
- 但我必须回去
我最喜欢的书

12:37.551 --> 12:40.862
of daily affirmations
to the library by noon,
每天的肯定
中午到图书馆，

12:40.931 --> 12:43.344
or I'll have to pay a penalty.
否则我将不得不支付罚款。

12:43.413 --> 12:46.655
- You mean this book?
[clears throat]
- 你是说这本书吗？
[清嗓子]

12:46.724 --> 12:50.137
"In life, 'tis better to play
hide-and-seek with the trees
“生活中，最好是玩
和树捉迷藏

12:50.206 --> 12:52.275
than checkers with the wind."
比随风跳棋。”

12:52.344 --> 12:54.689
Hey, that's what
Patrick always says.
嘿，就是这样
帕特里克总是这样说。

12:54.724 --> 12:56.448
- No, he doesn't.
- 不，他没有。

12:56.517 --> 12:58.965
Get your own affirmations.
得到你自己的肯定。

12:59.034 --> 13:02.068
[blimp humming overhead]
[飞艇在头顶嗡嗡作响]

13:05.655 --> 13:07.275
- Hi, SpongeBob.
- 嗨，海绵宝宝。

13:07.379 --> 13:09.413
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

13:12.620 --> 13:15.000
Here we go!
开始了！

13:18.034 --> 13:19.896
- Ha, 9:00 a.m.--
- 哈，上午 9:00--

13:19.931 --> 13:22.275
plenty of time
before the deadline.
有足够的时间
在截止日期之前。

13:22.379 --> 13:25.413
Yeah, you have to get up
pretty early in the morning.
是的，你必须起床
一大早。

13:25.482 --> 13:26.862
And I did.
我做到了。

13:26.931 --> 13:28.724
[mutters]
Ah, there it is--
[嘀咕]
啊，在那里——

13:28.793 --> 13:31.413
book returns, top floor.
还书，顶楼。

13:31.517 --> 13:34.931
[elevator bell dings]
[电梯铃声]

13:35.034 --> 13:37.586
both: Hey, Squidward.
Going up?
两人：嘿，章鱼哥。
上去吗？

13:37.620 --> 13:39.896
- Ah!
Uh, I'll take the next one.
- 啊！
呃，我去拿下一张。

13:39.965 --> 13:43.000
[elevator bell dinging]
[电梯铃声响起]

13:45.586 --> 13:46.965
[gasps]
[喘气]

13:47.068 --> 13:48.448
[sighs contentedly]
[满足地叹气]

13:48.551 --> 13:50.241
both: Squidward!
- Huh?
两人：章鱼哥！
- 啊？

13:50.275 --> 13:51.793
both: Hold the door!
两人：把门扶住！

13:51.896 --> 13:53.862
- Close the door.
Close the door. Close the door.
- 关门。
关门。关门。

13:53.931 --> 13:57.103
[both panting,
elevator bell dinging]
[两人都气喘吁吁，
电梯铃声响起]

14:02.034 --> 14:05.586
[both straining]
[双方都紧张]

14:05.655 --> 14:07.655
- Thanks for holding
the door, Squidward.
- 谢谢你的坚持
门，章鱼哥。

14:07.689 --> 14:09.172
- [grumbles]
- [抱怨]

14:09.241 --> 14:12.172
I thought you yo-yos
had a big day of fun planned.
我还以为你哟哟
计划了美好的一天。

14:12.241 --> 14:14.275
Why aren't you there?
你为什么不在？

14:14.344 --> 14:16.000
- We are there, Squidward,
- 我们在那里，章鱼哥，

14:16.068 --> 14:18.379
because today is...
因为今天是...

14:18.482 --> 14:21.344
both:
Elevator Riding Day!
两者：
乘坐电梯日！

14:21.413 --> 14:22.965
Wa-hoo!
哇呼！

14:23.000 --> 14:25.482
- [growls]
- [咆哮]

14:25.586 --> 14:28.206
I feel my anger.
我感到我的愤怒。

14:28.310 --> 14:32.758
But I am calm
like a plate of linguine.
但我很平静
就像一盘扁面条。

14:32.827 --> 14:34.758
Patrick, be a dear
帕特里克，做个亲爱的

14:34.827 --> 14:37.620
and hit the top-floor button
for me, please.
然后点击顶楼按钮
为我，请。

14:37.689 --> 14:39.482
- Top floor!
- 顶楼！

14:39.551 --> 14:42.862
Going up--right after we
hit all these other floors.
上来——就在我们之后
到达所有其他楼层。

14:42.931 --> 14:45.206
- [gasps] What are you doing?
- [喘气]你在做什么？

14:45.310 --> 14:47.551
- Yeah, Patrick,
what are you doing?
- 是的，帕特里克，
你在做什么？

14:47.620 --> 14:48.965
You missed one.
你错过了一个。

14:49.000 --> 14:51.275
Boop.
Every floor counts!
噗。
每层楼都很重要！

14:51.344 --> 14:52.586
Hey!
嘿！

14:52.655 --> 14:54.482
- Top floor first.
Top floor first.
- 首先是顶层。
先顶楼。

14:54.586 --> 14:57.517
[electricity crackling]
[电力噼啪声]

14:57.586 --> 14:59.724
[elevator rumbling]
[电梯隆隆声]

14:59.793 --> 15:04.551
Oh, no, we're trapped,
trapped like sardines!
哦，不，我们被困住了，
像沙丁鱼一样被困！

15:04.586 --> 15:06.275
- Don't worry, Squidward.
- 别担心，章鱼哥。

15:06.344 --> 15:08.241
This happens to us
all the time.
这发生在我们身上
一直。

15:08.310 --> 15:11.379
- Yeah, last week we only had
to wait five hours.
- 是的，上周我们只
要等五个小时。

15:11.482 --> 15:13.068
- "Five hours"?
- “五个小时”？

15:13.137 --> 15:16.034
That's past
the book-return deadline!
那已经过去了
还书期限到了！

15:16.068 --> 15:18.517
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

15:18.586 --> 15:23.000
Like a plate of linguine.
[sighs contentedly]
就像一盘扁面条。
[满足地叹气]

15:23.068 --> 15:26.620
Hey, why don't we just use
the emergency phone
嘿，我们为什么不直接使用
紧急电话

15:26.689 --> 15:28.413
and call for help?
并寻求帮助？

15:28.448 --> 15:33.103
- Well, if you want
to do it the easy way.
- 好吧，如果你愿意的话
以简单的方式做到这一点。

15:33.172 --> 15:35.827
[line trilling]
- Hello?
[行颤音]
- 你好？

15:35.896 --> 15:37.758
- Hello.
Oh, thank Neptune.
- 你好。
哦，谢谢海王星。

15:37.862 --> 15:39.931
- Oh, thank Neptune.
- 哦，谢谢海王星。

15:40.034 --> 15:42.241
- I didn't think
this phone would work.
- 我没想到
这个电话可以用。

15:42.310 --> 15:44.413
- I didn't think
this phone would work.
- 我没想到
这个电话可以用。

15:44.482 --> 15:45.931
- I'm trapped in an elevator.
- 我被困在电梯里了。

15:46.034 --> 15:48.172
- I'm trapped in an elevator.
- 我被困在电梯里了。

15:48.241 --> 15:49.724
- Stop saying what I'm saying!
- 别再说我说的话了！

15:49.827 --> 15:51.551
- Stop saying what I'm saying.
- 别再说我说的话了。

15:51.620 --> 15:54.000
- I really am trapped
in an elevator.
- 我真的被困住了
在电梯里。

15:54.068 --> 15:57.172
- I really am trapped
in an elevator.
- 我真的被困住了
在电梯里。

15:57.241 --> 15:59.310
[both growling]
- Gosh!
[双方咆哮]
- 天哪！

15:59.379 --> 16:01.103
Oh, you're no help at all.
哦，你根本帮不上忙。

16:01.137 --> 16:03.344
- [rasping]
You're no help at all.
- [刺耳]
你根本没有帮助。

16:03.413 --> 16:04.655
both:
Idiot!
两者：
白痴！

16:04.758 --> 16:06.344
- [growls]
- [咆哮]

16:06.413 --> 16:10.689
"Relaxation is the tippy toe
to tranquility."
“放松就是踮起脚尖
到宁静。”

16:10.758 --> 16:12.758
[sighs]
[叹气]

16:12.827 --> 16:14.275
- Now you relax.
- 现在你放松了。

16:14.310 --> 16:16.241
Patrick can fix it.
帕特里克可以解决这个问题。

16:16.310 --> 16:19.620
- Yeah, my dad
was an elevator surgeon
- 是的，我的爸爸
是一名电梯外科医生

16:19.724 --> 16:21.275
for a whole day.
一整天。

16:21.379 --> 16:22.931
- He was a what?
- 他是什么？

16:23.000 --> 16:24.655
- Screwdriver.
- 螺丝刀。

16:27.448 --> 16:28.793
Hmm.
唔。

16:28.896 --> 16:30.448
[grunts]
[咕哝]

16:32.172 --> 16:35.827
And now to connect
the right wires.
现在要连接
正确的电线。

16:35.931 --> 16:37.551
[electricity fizzing]
[电嘶嘶声]

16:37.620 --> 16:39.896
That's not it.
不是这个。

16:39.965 --> 16:41.517
- Wait, Patrick, don't!
- 等等，帕特里克，别这样！

16:43.517 --> 16:45.482
- [growls]
- [咆哮]

16:45.551 --> 16:48.000
- Patrick.
- 帕特里克.

16:48.103 --> 16:50.931
[rumbling]
[隆隆声]

16:51.000 --> 16:54.000
[all screaming]
[所有人尖叫]

16:55.448 --> 16:58.655
- Enough!
Get me out of here!
- 足够的！
带我离开这里！

16:58.758 --> 17:02.034
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

17:04.000 --> 17:06.310
[shouts]
[喊叫]

17:06.379 --> 17:09.620
Why won't these
stupid doors open?
为什么这些不会
愚蠢的门打开了？

17:09.689 --> 17:11.172
[elevator bell dings]
[电梯铃声]

17:11.206 --> 17:12.965
Huh?
啊？

17:13.034 --> 17:14.206
- Squidward!
- 章鱼哥！

17:14.241 --> 17:15.931
Grab my hand!
抓住我的手！

17:16.000 --> 17:17.896
- Huh?
- 啊？

17:19.586 --> 17:21.482
[whimpering]
[呜咽]

17:21.551 --> 17:24.241
[groans]
[呻吟]

17:24.310 --> 17:26.379
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

17:26.448 --> 17:29.379
[mellow music]
[柔和的音乐]

17:29.482 --> 17:34.034
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

17:34.103 --> 17:36.965
- That was a close one,
huh, Squidward?
- 那是一场亲密的比赛，
哈，章鱼哥？

17:37.034 --> 17:39.068
- What's that?
- 那是什么？

17:39.137 --> 17:40.413
both:
A door.
两者：
一扇门。

17:40.482 --> 17:43.862
[ethereal music]
[空灵的音乐]

17:43.965 --> 17:46.724
- [straining]
Hurry!
- [紧张]
快点！

17:46.827 --> 17:49.379
- Good luck, losers.
- 祝你好运，失败者。

17:49.482 --> 17:51.000
- Thanks, Squidward.
- 谢谢，章鱼哥。

17:51.068 --> 17:55.827
- Finally, that book
is getting returned on time.
- 最后，那本书
正在准时返回。

17:55.896 --> 17:57.517
Thank Neptune!
感谢海王星！

17:57.586 --> 17:59.310
both: Hey, Squidward.
- Huh?
两人：嘿，章鱼哥。
- 啊？

17:59.379 --> 18:00.482
both:
You're back.
两者：
你回来了。

18:00.551 --> 18:02.965
[suspenseful musical sting]
【悬疑的音乐刺痛】

18:03.068 --> 18:05.310
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

18:05.413 --> 18:08.620
both:
Now give us a boost.
两者：
现在给我们一个动力。

18:08.724 --> 18:13.448
- "Serenity floats
on an ocean of cheese."
——“宁静漂浮
在奶酪的海洋上。”

18:13.517 --> 18:15.689
[sighs contentedly]
[满足地叹气]

18:15.758 --> 18:17.655
[stomach growling]
[肚子咕咕叫]

18:17.724 --> 18:19.000
I'm starving.
我饿死了。

18:19.068 --> 18:21.275
How long have we been stuck
in here?
我们被困了多久
在这里？

18:21.344 --> 18:22.482
- Don't worry, Squidward.
- 别担心，章鱼哥。

18:22.586 --> 18:25.241
While you were out,
I ordered a pizza.
当你外出时，
我点了一份披萨。

18:25.275 --> 18:27.275
- Give me that, you pea brain.
- 给我这个，你这个豌豆脑子。

18:27.310 --> 18:29.862
We can call for help.
我们可以打电话寻求帮助。

18:29.931 --> 18:32.379
[cell phone beeping]
[手机提示音]

18:32.413 --> 18:33.758
Of course.
当然。

18:33.862 --> 18:36.620
[elevator bell dings]
- Pizza delivery.
[电梯铃声]
- 披萨外送。

18:36.724 --> 18:38.551
- Thanks.
- 谢谢。

18:38.620 --> 18:40.620
- We're saved!
- 我们得救了！

18:40.689 --> 18:42.758
[alarm ringing]
Patrick!
[警报响起]
帕特里克！

18:42.793 --> 18:46.000
[straining]
[紧张]

18:48.034 --> 18:50.758
- All right!
Let's eat!
- 好的！
我们吃饭吧！

18:50.827 --> 18:52.379
- Eat what?
- 吃什么？

18:52.448 --> 18:54.103
[stomach growling]
[肚子咕咕叫]

18:55.724 --> 18:59.482
- Now I'm starving, and my book
is going to be late.
- 现在我快饿死了，我的书
就要迟到了。

18:59.551 --> 19:01.000
[grunts]
[咕哝]

19:01.068 --> 19:04.103
"Only when all is lost can
you see inside your nostrils
“只有当一切都失去的时候
你看到你鼻孔里面

19:04.172 --> 19:06.310
and find yourself."
并找到你自己。”

19:06.344 --> 19:08.517
[sighs contentedly]
[满足地叹气]

19:08.620 --> 19:13.137
[both inhaling,
exhaling deeply]
[同时吸气，
深深地呼气]

19:15.517 --> 19:18.551
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

19:20.103 --> 19:21.448
Oh, ah.
哦，啊。

19:21.517 --> 19:23.413
[gasps, laughs]
[喘气，大笑]

19:23.482 --> 19:25.103
I'm free!
我自由了！

19:25.172 --> 19:27.103
After 22 years,
22年后，

19:27.172 --> 19:30.206
I finally got
out of that cursed elevator.
我终于得到了
从那个该死的电梯里出来。

19:30.310 --> 19:32.689
[laughing]
[笑]

19:32.758 --> 19:34.689
W-what?
Huh?
什、什么？
啊？

19:34.793 --> 19:37.586
[elevator bell dings]
Another elevator?
[电梯铃声]
另一部电梯？

19:37.655 --> 19:40.000
[elevator bell dings]
[screams]
[电梯铃声]
[尖叫声]

19:40.103 --> 19:41.310
- Greetings, stranger.
- 你好，陌生人。

19:41.379 --> 19:44.172
Welcome to our island
of tranquility.
欢迎来到我们的岛屿
的宁静。

19:44.275 --> 19:47.379
both: Going up.
[gong sounding]
两人：上升。
[锣声响起]

19:49.275 --> 19:52.862
- This is a lot nicer
than my old elevator.
- 这好多了
比我的旧电梯。

19:52.931 --> 19:55.758
Mind if I stay here a while?
介意我在这里待一会儿吗？

19:55.827 --> 19:58.517
- You'll have to ask the king.
- 你得去问国王。

19:58.620 --> 20:01.793
both: Going up.
[gong sounding]
两人：上升。
[锣声响起]

20:01.862 --> 20:06.241
- The king?
- Did someone say my name?
- 国王？
- 有人说了我的名字吗？

20:06.310 --> 20:08.310
- Oh, wise King Squidward.
- 哦，聪明的章鱼哥国王。

20:08.344 --> 20:11.275
This weary traveler
wishes to stay with us.
这位疲惫的旅人
希望和我们在一起。

20:11.344 --> 20:14.379
- Please, King,
can we keep him?
- 国王，请您
我们可以留住他吗？

20:17.965 --> 20:21.655
- Hmm.
Let me consult the book.
- 唔。
让我查阅一下书吧。

20:21.724 --> 20:23.310
[bell dings, ethereal singing]
[钟声叮叮，歌声空灵]

20:23.344 --> 20:27.551
both: The book.
The book.
两者：书。
这本书。

20:27.655 --> 20:32.103
- "A friend in need is
a servant guaranteed."
- “有需要的朋友是
保证有仆人。”

20:32.172 --> 20:33.551
[bell dings]
[铃声]

20:33.620 --> 20:36.517
The book says yes!
书上说是的！

20:36.551 --> 20:39.310
both: Going up!
[gong sounding]
两人：上升！
[锣声响起]

20:39.379 --> 20:42.793
- Of course you can stay
with us, my child.
- 当然你可以留下来
和我们在一起，我的孩子。

20:42.862 --> 20:45.896
We'll teach you
the ways of the book.
我们会教你
书中的方法。

20:45.965 --> 20:49.068
And you'll get to spend
every day
你会花
每天

20:49.137 --> 20:51.931
worshipping me.
崇拜我。

20:52.000 --> 20:54.344
[eerie music]
[诡异的音乐]

20:54.413 --> 20:57.896
both:
You'll be just like us.
两者：
你会和我们一样。

20:58.000 --> 20:59.241
- Oh, gee.
- 哦，天哪。

20:59.344 --> 21:01.620
Oh, hey, is that the doorbell?
哦，嘿，那是门铃吗？

21:01.689 --> 21:03.241
I-I think I left the oven on.
我-我想我没关烤箱。

21:03.310 --> 21:05.068
[laughs]
Whoo!
[笑]
呼！

21:05.103 --> 21:07.310
[screams]
[thud]
[尖叫声]
[砰]

21:07.379 --> 21:08.724
- Listen, my people,
- 听着，我的人民，

21:08.793 --> 21:11.517
the book says it's time
for me to relax.
书上说是时候了
让我放松。

21:11.586 --> 21:12.965
[knocking]
Huh?
[敲门声]
啊？

21:13.068 --> 21:15.068
- Hello?
Are you all right in there?
- 你好？
你在里面还好吗？

21:15.137 --> 21:18.689
- Yes, yes, I'm all right!
Get me out!
- 是的，是的，我没事！
放我出去！

21:22.448 --> 21:23.896
Oh, thank you.
哦，谢谢。

21:23.965 --> 21:26.310
Thank you for rescuing me
from these stupid--
谢谢你救了我
来自这些愚蠢的人——

21:26.413 --> 21:28.896
- Are you Squidward Tentacles?
- Yes.
- 你是章鱼哥触手吗？
- 是的。

21:28.931 --> 21:30.586
- We've been looking for you.
- 我们一直在找你。

21:30.655 --> 21:32.586
We're the library police.
我们是图书馆警察。

21:32.620 --> 21:36.655
You have a withdrawn book
that is now 30 seconds overdue.
您有一本已撤回的书
现在已逾期 30 秒。

21:36.758 --> 21:39.206
And you'll have to pay
the penalty.
你必须付出代价
处罚。

21:39.275 --> 21:41.275
- What do I owe you--
like, a nickel?
- 我欠你什么--
比如，五分钱？

21:41.310 --> 21:45.310
[laughs]
- You're going to library jail.
[笑]
- 你要去图书馆监狱。

21:45.413 --> 21:48.413
- [sighs contentedly]
Library jail--
- [满足地叹气]
图书馆监狱——

21:48.517 --> 21:50.551
how relaxing.
多么放松啊。

21:50.620 --> 21:54.689
"I appreciate myself
by taking time to recharge
“我很欣赏自己
花时间充电

21:54.758 --> 21:57.000
"with my best friend--
“和我最好的朋友——

21:57.068 --> 21:58.586
me."
我。”

21:58.655 --> 22:00.448
[sighs contentedly]
[满足地叹气]

22:00.517 --> 22:03.620
[elevator whirring, bell dings]
[电梯呼呼、铃声叮叮]

22:05.793 --> 22:09.827
both: Oh, wise king,
we missed you so.
两人：噢，明智的国王，
我们非常想念你。

22:09.931 --> 22:12.241
- Why, Neptune?
- 为什么，海王星？

22:12.310 --> 22:14.379
Why?
为什么？

22:14.482 --> 22:16.517
- We had overdue books, too.
- 我们也有过期的书。

22:16.551 --> 22:19.827
both: Going up.
[gong sounding]
两人：上升。
[锣声响起]

22:19.931 --> 22:20.965
- [grunting]
Going up!
- [咕哝]
上升！

- [咕哝]
上升！